This package contains modified Geti UI source files based on the upstream
app/v3.2.0 release, commit 9456821d060a2143cf05a2e01504acbb9924a578.
The modifications add Simplified Chinese localization. FILE_LIST.md lists
the modified and added files; USAGE.md describes how to apply the changes.
The original per-file copyright and license notices are retained.

